// Reading one field of one event back, by its index in the events table and its
// slot. The slots are the log_slot_* constants of conf.id, read at the call site
// as (import log_slot_item) and the like: item, answer, verdict, tapped and grade
// are text (unescaped), confidence, hints, seconds and rung are numbers. A slot
// the event's kind does not have is the caller's mistake and stops the program
// with an index error, so look at events.kinds[index] first.

log_text_at(Log_events log_events_in, int log_index, int log_slot) {
  string log_text_read = log_restore(log_events_in.fields[log_index][log_slot]);
} return string log_text_read;
